{"id":"word:hebrew:H1875","type":"word","title":"דָּרַשׁ","subtitle":"H1875 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, to tread or frequent ; usually to follow (for pursuit or search); by implication, to seek or ask ; specifically to worship","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to דָּרַשׁ (H1875) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 165 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"דָּרַשׁ (dârash) means properly, to tread or frequent ; usually to follow (for pursuit or search); by implication, to seek or ask ; specifically to worship First listed occurrence: 1Chr 10 13."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"דָּרַשׁ","transliteration":"dârash","pronunciation":"daw-rash'","strong":"H1875","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1875","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["לִ/דְרֹ֣שׁ","לִ/דְר֣וֹשׁ","דּוֹרֵ֣שׁ","דְּרָשׁ","לִ/דְר֕וֹשׁ"],"morphs":[["HR/Vqc",32],["HVqv2mp",11],["HVqrmsa",11],["HVqp3ms",6],["HVqp3cp",6],["HVqi1cs",6],["HVqi2ms",5],["HVNi1cs",5],["HVqi3ms",4],["HC/Vqq2ms",4]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, to tread or frequent ; usually to follow (for pursuit or search); by implication, to seek or ask ; specifically to worship","usage":"ask, × at all, care for, × diligently, inquire, make inquisition, (necro-) mancer, question, require, search, seek (for, out), × surely.","full":"H1875. darash דַּרְיוֺשׁ Ezra 10:16 see דרשׁ . דָּרַשׁ 162 verb resort to, seek (compare Arabic rub over, efface (a site), tread (wheat), figurative read repeatedly, study ; beat (a path), discuss , Pa`el practise in ; Late Hebrew search out (a meaning), expound ) — Qal Perfect 1Chr 10:14 ; Imperfect יִדְרשׁ Psa 10:4 +, אֶדְרְשָׁה 1Sam 28:7 , נִדְרְשָׁה 1Kin 22:7 +, יִדְרְשׁוּן Isa 55:2 ; Imperative דְּרָשֿׁ 1Kin 22:5 +; Infinitive absolute דָּרשׁ Lev 10:16 ; Deut 23:22 ; construct דְּרשׁ 22:2 + לִדְרָשֿׁ Ezek 14:7 , לְדַרְיוֺשׁ (scribal error for לִדְרוֺשׁ Ew § 239a Ol § 245 g ) Ezra 10:16 ; Participle דֹּרֵשׁ Deut 11:12 10 t., דּוֺרֵשׁ 1Chr 28:9 3 t.; passive דְּרוּשִׁים Psa 111:2 , דְּרוּשָׁה Isa 62:12 ; synonym בקשׁ ; — 1 ( tread a place,) resort to, frequent , with religious object, with accusative of location Amos 5:5 ; 2Chr 1:5 , לְ local Deut 12:5 . 2 seek, consult, inquire of: a. accusative אֱלֹהִים ׳י, Gen 25:22 (J) Exod 18:15 (E) 1Sam 9:9 ; 1Kin 22:8 ; 2Kin 3:11 ; 8:8 ; 22:13 , 18 ; 1Chr 15:13 ; 21:30 ; 2Chr 18:7 ; 34:21 ; Psa 24:6 ; 78:34 ; Jer 21:2 ; 37:7 ; Ezek 20:1 , 3 ; the ark of God 1Chr 13:3 ; word of Yahweh 1Kin 22:5 (= 2Chr 18:4 ) compare 1Kin 14:5 ; with בְּ Yahweh 1Chr 10:14 ; 2Chr 34:26 ; Ezek 14:7 ; his word 2Kin 1:16 ; with אֶלאֵֿל אֶל, Job 5:8 ; their God Isa 8:19 , Messianic king 11:10 ; י ׳מֵעַלסֵֿפֶר out of the book of ׳י 34:16 (in gloss, according to Che JQ Jan. 1892, 332 ); with מֵאוֺתוֺ of a לי ׳נָבִיא 1Kin 22:7 (= 2Chr 18:6 ) compare (above) 18:8 ; 2Kin 3:11 and 1Kin 14:5 ( מֵעִמְּךָ ). b. heathen gods and necromancers , הַדֹּרֵשׁ the inquirer Ezek 14:10 ; with אוֺב בַּעֲלַת בְּ, 1Sam 28:7 , בָּאוֺב 1Chr 10:13 , זְבוּב בְּבַעַל 2Kin 1:2-3 , 6 , 16 ; with אֶלהָֿאֹבוֺת אֶל, Isa 8:19 , אֶלהַֿמֵּתִים Deut 18:11 , אֶלהָֿאֱלִילִים Isa 19:3 . 3 seek deity in prayer and worship: a. the true God (compare בקשׁ 3 ) י ׳דרשׁ Deut 4:29 ; Hosea 10:12 ; Amos 5:4 , 6 ; Isa 9:12 ; 31:1 ; 55:6 ; 58:2 ; 65:10 ; Jer 10:21 ; 29:13 ; Zeph 1:6 ; Lam 3:25 ; 1Chr 16:11 (= Psa 105:4 ) 28:9 ; 2Chr 12:14 ; 14:3 ; 14:6 ; 15:2 , 12 ; 16:12 ; 22:9 ; 26:5 ; Psa 9:11 ; 22:27 ; 34:5 ; 34:11 ; 119:2 ; 119:10 ; (ה)אלהים דרשׁ 2Chr 19:3 ; 26:5 ; 30:19 ; Psa 14:2 (= 53:3 ) 69:33 ; ד ׳אֲדֹנָי 77:3 ; with לְ , only in Chronicler, ליהוה 1Chr 22:19 ; 2Chr 15:13 ; 20:3 ; Ezra 6:21 ; לאלהים 2Chr 17:4 ; 31:21 ; 34:3 ; Ezra 4:2 ; Dr Intr. 503 finds in Chronicles weakened meaning, revere. b. seek heathen deities , with accusative Jer 8:2 ; 2Chr 25:15 , 20 ; with לְ , Deut 12:30 ; 2Chr 17:3 . 4. a. seek , with idea of demanding, require ( בקשׁ is seek , simply), with accusative lost sheep Deut 22:2 ; Ezek 34:6 , 8 , 11 ; goat Lev 10:16 (twice in verse) (P); with אחר , after green fodder Job 39:8 . b. inquire, investigate (a matter), absolute Judg 6:29 ; Deut 13:15 ; 17:4 , 9 ; 19:18 ; with accusative י ׳דּוֺרֵשׁ כָּללְֿבָבוֺת all hearts Yahweh searches 1Chr 28:9 ; הַמּוֺפֵת לִדְרשׁ to inquire into the wonder 2Chr 32:31 ; with לְ , to inquire about 2Sam 11:3 ; Job 10:6 ; followed by עַל person + infinitive 2Chr 24:6 apply to the Levites to bring , etc., compare 31:9 ( עַל both person and thing). 5 ask for, require, demand , with accusative of thing Ezek 20:40 ; + מִן person Deut 23:22 ; Micah 6:8 ; exact , often with collateral idea of avenging , מֵעִם Deut 18:19 , so with מִיַּד Ezek 34:10 , מִיַּד דָּם דָּרַשׁ Gen 9:5 (P) Ezek 33:6 ; accusative only, דמים דֹּרֵשׁ Psa 9:13 , ׳ד רִשְׁעוֺ 10:15 ; absolute 10:4 ; 10:13 ; 2Chr 24:22 . 6 seek with application, study, follow, practise , absolute by wisdom Eccl 1:13 ; with accusative ׳ד מִשְׁמָּט study or practise justice Isa 1:17 ; 16:5 ; י ׳מַעֲשֵׂי Psa 111:2 ; וְאַלרַֿע טוֺב Amos 5:14 ; commands of God Psa 119:45 ; 119:94 ; 119:155 ; 1Chr 28:8 ; the law Ear 7:10 ; ׳ד שׁלום seek or study the peace, welfare of any one Deut 23:7 ; Jer 29:7 ; Ezra 9:12 , לשׁלום Jer 38:4 , ׳ד טוב Est 10:3 , ׳ד רעה Prov 11:27 ; Psa 38:13 (compare בקשׁ 2 , where this use is more common). 7 seek with care, care for , אתהּ דֹּרֵשׁ אלהיך יהוה אשׁר ארץ land which Yahweh thy God careth for Deut 11:12 ; אֱלוֺהַּ אַליִֿדְרְשֵׁהוּ let not Eloah care for it Job 3:4 ; יִד לֹא ׳אוֺתָךְ Jer 30:14 ; צֶמֶר דָּֽרְשָׁה Prov 31:13 ; with לְ Jer 30:17 ; לְנַפְשִׁי דּוֺרֵשׁ אֵין no one careth for me Psa 142:5 ; but in both these לְ perhaps belongs to אֵין , compare || מַכִּיר לִי אֵין 142:5 , also Lam 4:4 etc.; דְּרוּשָׁה cared for (of Jerusalem) Isa 62:12 . Niph`al Perfect נִדְרָ֑שׁ Gen 42:22 , נִדְרַשְׁתִּי Isa 65:1 , נִדְרָ֑שׁוּ 1Chr 26:31 ; Imperfect אִדָּרֵשׁ Ezek 14:3 ; 20:3 , 31 , 31 ; 36:37 ; Infinitive absolute הַאִדָּרשׁ 14:3 (for ההדרשׁ ); — 1 let oneself be inquired of, consulted , only of God Ezek 14:3 (twice in verse); 20:3 , 31 , 31 ; 36:37 ; Isa 65:1 . 2 be sought out 1Chr 26:31 . 3 be required , of blood (compare Qal 5 ) Gen 42:22 (E). Note. — מֵחָרְבוֺתֵיהֶם וְדָרְשׁוּ and beg out of their desolate places Psa 109:10 (Ki and others wed©ršu , see Baer); many MSS. read דָּֽרְשׁוּ , so most interpretations; ᵐ5 Hup Bi Che read גֹּרְשׁוּ be driven from .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 10 13","keyReferences":["1Chr 10 13","1Chr 10 14","1Chr 13 3","1Chr 15 13","1Chr 16 11","1Chr 21 30","1Chr 22 19","1Chr 26 31"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":165,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 10 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":10,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/דְרֽוֹשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vqc"},{"reference":"1Chr 10 14","book":"1Chr","chapter":10,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דָרַ֥שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 13 3","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְרַשְׁנֻ֖/הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp1cp/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְרַשְׁנֻ֖/הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp1cp/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דִּרְשׁ֤וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqv2mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 21 30","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/דְרֹ֣שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vqc"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/דְר֖וֹשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vqc"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 31","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִדְרָ֔שׁוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVNp3cp"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 8","book":"1Chr","chapte